{"unit_id": "tag:0BAG:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。假设<MATH_0002>是局部诺特（locally Noetherian）的，且<MATH_0003>是局部有限型（locally of finite type）的。\n则\n<MATH_0004>\n其中<MATH_0005>是<MATH_0006>的上确界（supremum），而<MATH_0007>遍历<MATH_0008>的各不可约分支（irreducible components）的泛点（generic points）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "supremum", "target_term": "上确界"}, {"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支"}, {"source_term": "generic points", "target_term": "泛点"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "态射的源和靶所在的范畴"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引理所讨论的概形间映射"}, {"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特", "context": "引理对概形的局部性假设"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型", "context": "引理对态射的型别假设"}, {"source_term": "supremum", "target_term": "上确界", "context": "对所述各值取的上确界"}, {"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支", "context": "用其泛点确定取值范围的分支"}, {"source_term": "generic points", "target_term": "泛点", "context": "变量所遍历的各不可约分支的点"}], "notes": []}
